'''No-Pillar''' is an [[Combat Achievements/Elite|elite combat achievement]] which requires the player to survive [[Verzik Vitur|Verzik Vitur's]] pillar phase in the [[Theatre of Blood/Entry Mode|Theatre of Blood: Entry Mode]] without losing a single [[Supporting Pillar|pillar]].

== Strategy ==
Have every player use the [[Dawnbringer|Dawnbringer's]] special attack multiple times to quickly end the encounter. Avoid teammates spreading between multiple pillars. If one pillar is taking too much damage, preemptively move to another.

